<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Documentación de la API para Desarrolladores — Möno</title>
    <link href="https://api.fontshare.com/v2/css?f[]=satoshi@400,500,700,800,900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
    <style>
        body {
            background-color: #14181C;
            color: #FFFFFF;
            font-family: 'Satoshi', -apple-system, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }
        .api-hero {
            padding: 60px 0 36px;
            text-align: center;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
        }
        .api-badge {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
            background: rgba(255,85,0,0.15);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,85,0,0.3);
            padding: 5px 14px;
            border-radius: 99px;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--orange);
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }
        .api-title {
            font-size: 38px;
            font-weight: 900;
            letter-spacing: -1.2px;
            margin: 0 0 10px 0;
            color: #FFFFFF;
        }
        .api-container {
            max-width: 860px;
            margin: 48px auto;
        }
        .endpoint-card {
            background: #181D22;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
            border-radius: 14px;
            padding: 24px 28px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
        }
        .endpoint-header {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }
        .http-method {
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 800;
            padding: 4px 10px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }
        .http-get {
            background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15);
            color: #38BDF8;
            border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.3);
        }
        .http-post {
            background: rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.15);
            color: #4ADE80;
            border: 1px solid rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.3);
        }
        .endpoint-path {
            font-family: monospace;
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #FFFFFF;
        }
        .code-block {
            background: #14181C;
            color: #CAD2D9;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 14px 18px;
            font-family: 'SFMono-Regular', Consolas, 'Liberation Mono', Menlo, Courier, monospace;
            font-size: 13px;
            overflow-x: auto;
            margin-top: 12px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <%- include('partials/nav') %>

    <div class="api-hero">
        <div class="wrap">
            <div class="api-badge">
                <span>⚡</span> API REST v1
            </div>
            <h1 class="api-title">Möno Developer API</h1>
            <p style="color:var(--muted); font-size:15px; max-width:540px; margin:0 auto; line-height:1.6;">
                Accede programáticamente al catálogo de anime, búsqueda instantánea, reseñas de la comunidad y estados de episodios.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="wrap">
        <div class="api-container">
            <div class="endpoint-card">
                <div class="endpoint-header">
                    <span class="http-method http-get">GET</span>
                    <span class="endpoint-path">/api/search/anime?q={query}</span>
                </div>
                <p style="font-size:14px; color:var(--muted); margin:0;">Búsqueda instantánea de anime por título en inglés o japonés con límite de resultados.</p>
                <div class="code-block">
// Ejemplo de respuesta:
[
  {
    "id": 1,
    "slug": "nge",
    "title": "Neon Genesis Evangelion",
    "year": 1995,
    "studio": "Gainax",
    "cover_image": "/images/nge_cover_1785281259269.png"
  }
]
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="endpoint-card">
                <div class="endpoint-header">
                    <span class="http-method http-post">POST</span>
                    <span class="endpoint-path">/api/progress/update</span>
                </div>
                <p style="font-size:14px; color:var(--muted); margin:0;">Actualiza el número de episodio actual visto con validación de límite de emisión en tiempo real.</p>
                <div class="code-block">
// Request Body JSON:
{
  "slug": "frieren-beyond-journeys-end",
  "episode": 5,
  "status": "watching"
}
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="endpoint-card">
                <div class="endpoint-header">
                    <span class="http-method http-post">POST</span>
                    <span class="endpoint-path">/api/anime/{slug}/log</span>
                </div>
                <p style="font-size:14px; color:var(--muted); margin:0;">Registra o actualiza en la misma solapa la calificación (0-5 estrellas), reseña, spoiler tag y estado del anime.</p>
                <div class="code-block">
// Request Body JSON:
{
  "rating": 4.5,
  "reviewText": "Una obra maestra de la animación.",
  "containsSpoilers": false,
  "isLiked": true,
  "status": "completed"
}
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
